# Only what the image build needs: the crate and the relay console's
# sources. Nothing that could carry a credential, a relay database, a key
# file or a customer's letter is sent to the build context, so it cannot end
# up in a layer.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!src/
!deny.toml
!relay-console/
relay-console/node_modules
relay-console/dist
relay-console/test-results
relay-console/playwright-report
src/lab/**/*.wasm
